NOTICE

This project is a derivative work based on "claude-for-legal" by Anthropic, PBC.
The original repository is available at:
    https://github.com/anthropics/claude-for-legal

Portions of this project — specifically the commercial-legal cluster (all
skills), substantial portions of the corporate-legal cluster, and the
matter-management subset of the litigation-legal cluster — reference an
intermediate Chinese localization by 陈石 (CSlawyer1985):
    https://github.com/CSlawyer1985/claude-for-legal-ZH (Apache-2.0)

Other clusters (ai-governance-legal, ip-legal, law-student, legal-builder-hub,
regulatory-legal, legal-research-cn) are substantially original adaptations
by the 元力工场 team based on the Anthropic upstream.

Modifications and additions in this project include:
- Localization of legal skills for People's Republic of China law
- Integration with Chinese legal databases (元典 / Yuandian API)
- Runtime-neutral SKILL.md design (replaces ~/.claude/ with $LEGAL_AGENT_PROFILE_HOME/)
- Original China-specific skills not present in upstream
- Jurisdiction-specific content for Chinese legal practice

All upstream works remain under their respective Apache-2.0 licenses. This
derivative work is licensed under Apache-2.0 as stated above.
